## macOS / Xcode
.DS_Store
xcuserdata/
*.xcworkspace/contents.xcworkspacedata
build/
DerivedData/

## SPM
.build/
.swiftpm/

## Firebase native config — developer-supplied secret, never commit.
## The plist is dragged into the Xcode target with "Copy items if needed"
## UNCHECKED so the file lives only in firebase/ and stays gitignored.
firebase/GoogleService-Info.plist
## Defensive — also covers an Android scaffold if you ever add one.
firebase/google-services.json
google-services.json

## Apple signing certs — critical for iOS distribution. Never commit.
*.p8
*.p12
*.mobileprovision
*.cer

## Secrets — defensive (the demo never reads any of these, but parents
## of this repo may scaffold env files that end up here).
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env.development
.env.production
*secret*
*credential*
*.pem
*.keystore
*.jks
